{
  "esm": "2.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "DiamondChain",
    "description": "Named steps (spec \u00a74.6): 12 levels of observed, each level's two observed reading both of the level below, so the inlined right-hand side doubles per level (2^12 paths) while the composed bands stay linear in the levels. The top level is read pointwise by u and through a contraction by v."
  },
